WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.592
Here are the main habits to keep from Module 12.

00:00:03.592 --> 00:00:07.002
Treat important views as contracts.

00:00:07.002 --> 00:00:11.937
Keep stable shared logic separate from temporary report logic.

00:00:11.937 --> 00:00:15.607
Do not assume that every view can be updated.

00:00:15.607 --> 00:00:18.302
Be precise about security.

00:00:18.302 --> 00:00:26.207
A narrower view can reduce exposure, but actual authorization depends on permissions and related controls.

00:00:26.207 --> 00:00:31.942
And remember that a materialized view always creates a freshness responsibility.

00:00:31.942 --> 00:00:37.318
If you store a snapshot, users need to know how and when it is refreshed.
